<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reçu de paiement</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f0fdf4;
            font-family: 'Outfit', Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        /* ── Header ── */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #22c55e 100%);
            padding: 36px 40px 32px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header-icon {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .checkmark {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            stroke: white;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* ── Amount badge ── */
        .amount-section {
            padding: 28px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        }

        .amount-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #9ca3af;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .amount-value {
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #14532d;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .amount-currency {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #16a34a;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }

        /* ── Body ── */
        .body {
            padding: 28px 40px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .intro {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* ── Receipt table ── */
        .receipt-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #9ca3af;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .receipt-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: #f9fafb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .receipt-table tr {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        }

        .receipt-table tr:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .receipt-table td {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .td-label {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-weight: 400;
            width: 40%;
        }

        .td-value {
            color: #1f2937;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .td-value.mono {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .td-value.status-ok {
            color: #16a34a;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* ── CTA button ── */
        .cta-block {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #22c55e 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .footer {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-icon">
                <svg class="checkmark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h1>Paiement confirmé !</h1>
            <p>Votre transaction a été traitée avec succès.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Amount -->
        <div class="amount-section">
            <div class="amount-label">Montant payé</div>
            <div class="amount-value">
                {{amount}}<span class="amount-currency">{{currency}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="body">
            <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{name}},</p>
            <p class="intro">
                Nous vous confirmons que votre paiement pour <strong>{{itemName}}</strong>
                a bien été reçu et traité. Vous trouverez ci-dessous le détail de votre reçu.
            </p>

            <div class="receipt-title">Détail de la transaction</div>
            <table class="receipt-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-label">Description</td>
                    <td class="td-value">{{itemName}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-label">Montant</td>
                    <td class="td-value">{{amount}} {{currency}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-label">Méthode</td>
                    <td class="td-value">Carte bancaire (SATIM)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-label">Référence</td>
                    <td class="td-value mono">{{transactionId}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="td-label">Statut</td>
                    <td class="td-value status-ok">✓ Approuvé</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="cta-block">
                <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="cta-button">Accéder à ma plateforme</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Conservez cet email comme preuve de paiement.<br>
                © 2025 E-Learning Platform. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>